concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sec-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "4 Review of operation of amendments"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of the operation of the amendments made by Schedule 1 to this Act.    No. 16, 2024 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 (2) The review must commence as soon as practicable after the end of the period of 24 months after the commencement of this Act. (3) The persons who undertake the review must give the Minister a written report of the review within 6 months of the commencement of the review. (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report of the review to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the report is given to the Minister.  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024" ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister must cause an independent review to be undertaken of the operation of the amendments made by Schedule 1 to this Act.    No. 16, 2024 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 (2) The review must commence as soon as practicable after the end of the period of 24 months after the commencement of this Act. (3) The persons who undertake the review must give the Minister a written report of the review within 6 months of the commencement of the review. (4) The Minister must cause a copy of the report of the review to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the report is given to the Minister.  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0a4e239537248d80cb4f855211a0ff1ac1e805e5b62ea0b4555363d826df1eb4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "6"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sec-4-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sec-4-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sec-4-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sec-4-ss-4 ;
