concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zf a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZF Designated complaints"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-154zf ;
    values:originalText "(1) A designated complainant may make a complaint under this section to the Commission. (2) The complaint must: (a) be in writing; and (b) if the Commission has approved a manner for making the complaint—be made in that manner; and (c) if the Commission has approved a form for making the complaint: (i) be made in the approved form; and (ii) include the information required by the form; and  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024 (iii) be accompanied by any documents required by the form; and (d) meet the requirements (if any) prescribed in the designated complaints determination relating to the number and types of designated complaints that a designated complainant may make during a specified period. (3) The complaint is a designated complaint starting from the day it meets the requirements mentioned in subsection (2)." ;
    skos:definition "(1) A designated complainant may make a complaint under this section to the Commission. (2) The complaint must: (a) be in writing; and (b) if the Commission has approved a manner for making the complaint—be made in that manner; and (c) if the Commission has approved a form for making the complaint: (i) be made in the approved form; and (ii) include the information required by the form; and  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024 (iii) be accompanied by any documents required by the form; and (d) meet the requirements (if any) prescribed in the designated complaints determination relating to the number and types of designated complaints that a designated complainant may make during a specified period. (3) The complaint is a designated complaint starting from the day it meets the requirements mentioned in subsection (2)."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8aa55286523a147ef2fb2186b58626c508b29d547674141250f837d4a09d9d05" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zf-ss-1 ;
