concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zh-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZH(4) Notice—no further action on complaint"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-154zh-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) This subsection applies if the Commission is satisfied that the subject matter of the complaint is, or is part of, a matter: (a) into which any of the following is inquiring or has within the past 2 years inquired: (i) a committee of the Parliament or of either House of the Parliament; (ii) a Royal Commission; (iii) a coronial inquiry, coronial investigation or coronial inquest; or (b) which is the subject of: (i) legal proceedings; or (ii) an inquiry, investigation or review conducted by the Commonwealth, a State or Territory, an industry organisation, a consumer organisation or another person; that is, or is of a kind, prescribed in the designated complaints determination. Appropriate to take no further action on complaint" ;
    skos:definition "(4) This subsection applies if the Commission is satisfied that the subject matter of the complaint is, or is part of, a matter: (a) into which any of the following is inquiring or has within the past 2 years inquired: (i) a committee of the Parliament or of either House of the Parliament; (ii) a Royal Commission; (iii) a coronial inquiry, coronial investigation or coronial inquest; or (b) which is the subject of: (i) legal proceedings; or (ii) an inquiry, investigation or review conducted by the Commonwealth, a State or Territory, an industry organisation, a consumer organisation or another person; that is, or is of a kind, prescribed in the designated complaints determination. Appropriate to take no further action on complaint"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3e4cf63df0127993e499a5c71bf8a2cad7b617a51ceddbd9c925350c58a0c99a" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zh ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No further action on complaint if certain conditions met" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
