    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-154zh-ss-5 ;
    values:originalText "(5) This subsection applies if: (a) the Commission has assessed the complaint; and (b) the Commission is satisfied that it is appropriate to take no further action in relation to the complaint.  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024" ;
    skos:definition "(5) This subsection applies if: (a) the Commission has assessed the complaint; and (b) the Commission is satisfied that it is appropriate to take no further action in relation to the complaint.  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024"@en ;
