doc:sch-1-sec-154zh-ss-5 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "154ZH(5) Notice—no further action on complaint" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(5) This subsection applies if: (a) the Commission has assessed the complaint; and (b) the Commission is satisfied that it is appropriate to take no further action in relation to the complaint.  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zh-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZH(6) Notice—no further action on complaint"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-154zh-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (5)(b), in considering whether the Commission is satisfied that it is appropriate, the Commission: (a) must have regard to any matter prescribed for the purposes of this paragraph in the designated complaints determination; and (b) may have regard to any matter prescribed for the purposes of this paragraph in the designated complaints determination." ;
    skos:definition "(6) For the purposes of paragraph (5)(b), in considering whether the Commission is satisfied that it is appropriate, the Commission: (a) must have regard to any matter prescribed for the purposes of this paragraph in the designated complaints determination; and (b) may have regard to any matter prescribed for the purposes of this paragraph in the designated complaints determination."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5933b9a53a6d1be6d998b73face7587e5b4b7d82ec3241d7610767fab1eb46a7" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zh ;
