doc:sch-1-sec-154zk-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "154ZK(3) Notice—further action to deal with complaint" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The Commission must: (a) use its best endeavours to commence the actions set out in the notice as soon as practicable after giving the notice; and (b) in any case, commence the actions set out in the notice within the period of 6 months after giving the notice; and  Designated complaints  Schedule 1  No. 16, 2024 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 (c) when the actions set out in the notice have been completed, use its best endeavours to notify this to the entity that made the complaint (even if the entity has ceased to be a designated complainant). Circumstances in which Commission not required to take further action" ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zk-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
