concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zr a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZR Conditions in approval"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-154zr ;
    values:originalText "(1) The approval may specify that it is subject to conditions if the Minister is satisfied that the conditions are appropriate. Considerations (2) For the purposes of being satisfied that the conditions are appropriate, the Minister: (a) must have regard to the matters mentioned in subsection 154ZQ(2); and (b) may have regard to the matters mentioned in subsection 154ZQ(3). Conditions notices (3) If the Minister is considering:  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024 (a) granting the approval; and (b) specifying that it is subject to conditions; the Minister may give the applicant a notice in writing setting out those conditions. (4) If the Minister gives the applicant a notice under subsection (3), the Minister must give the Commission a copy of the notice as soon as practicable." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The approval may specify that it is subject to conditions if the Minister is satisfied that the conditions are appropriate. Considerations (2) For the purposes of being satisfied that the conditions are appropriate, the Minister: (a) must have regard to the matters mentioned in subsection 154ZQ(2); and (b) may have regard to the matters mentioned in subsection 154ZQ(3). Conditions notices (3) If the Minister is considering:  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024 (a) granting the approval; and (b) specifying that it is subject to conditions; the Minister may give the applicant a notice in writing setting out those conditions. (4) If the Minister gives the applicant a notice under subsection (3), the Minister must give the Commission a copy of the notice as soon as practicable."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7840135e6b64f0d85df36e5e06971078f050a39abb3a3ee67aa3ec2be71a24ce" ;
    cof:pageNumber "17"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zr-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zr-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zr-ss-3 ;
