doc:sch-1-sec-154zu a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "154ZU Variation or revocation of approval" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) A designated complainant may apply to the Minister for a variation or revocation of its approval.  Designated complaints  Schedule 1  No. 16, 2024 Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 (2) The application must be: (a) in writing; and (b) in the approved form. Withdrawal of application (3) The designated complainant may, in writing, withdraw the application if the Minister has not decided it. (4) If the designated complainant withdraws the application, it is taken never to have been made." ;
    cof:pageNumber "18"^^xsd:integer .

