doc:sch-1-sec-154zv-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "154ZV(2) Minister may vary or revoke approval" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) Paragraphs (1)(a) and (b) do not apply if: (a) the variation or revocation is in accordance with an application under subsection 154ZU(1); or (b) in the case of a variation—the Minister is satisfied that the variation is of a minor or technical nature. Considerations" ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer .

concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zv-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "154ZV(3) Minister may vary or revoke approval"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-154zv-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) For the purposes of being satisfied that it is appropriate to make the variation or revocation, the Minister may have regard to the following matters: (a) any matter mentioned in subsection 154ZQ(2) or (3); (b) whether the designated complainant has contravened, or is contravening, a condition to which the approval is subject; (c) any matter prescribed in the designated complaints determination; (d) any other matter the Minister considers relevant.  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024 Notice of proposed variation or revocation" ;
    skos:definition "(3) For the purposes of being satisfied that it is appropriate to make the variation or revocation, the Minister may have regard to the following matters: (a) any matter mentioned in subsection 154ZQ(2) or (3); (b) whether the designated complainant has contravened, or is contravening, a condition to which the approval is subject; (c) any matter prescribed in the designated complaints determination; (d) any other matter the Minister considers relevant.  Schedule 1  Designated complaints  Competition and Consumer Amendment (Fair Go for Consumers and Small Business) Act 2024 No. 16, 2024 Notice of proposed variation or revocation"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "116428aa2ee3c71b791733c8a37974f1512e1fd4539129dca919138afce75c86" ;
    values:partOf concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-fair-go-for-consumers-and-small-business-act-sch-1-sec-154zv ;
    cof:pageNumber "19"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Minister may consider various matters when varying or revoking approval." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
