    skos:prefLabel "154ZZ Designated complaints determination"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-154zz ;
    values:originalText "The Minister may, by legislative instrument, make a determination (the designated complaints determination) prescribing matters required or permitted by this Part to be prescribed by the designated complaints determination." ;
